<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - Paribas maintains Aegon as Buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - Paribas maintains Aegon as Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of results flash.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Aegon	     Insurance     93.00   Paribas Capital Mkts</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (Buy). Aegon's stock has moved ahead strongly recently, outperforming a strong market by six percent in the last month alone. Nevertheless stock is still rated at a discount to market. We remain keen buyers of this growth stock.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	P/E	Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	5.04    18.5	2.37</p>
<p>    1996		   5.87    15.9	2.70</p>
<p>    1997		   6.46    14.4	3.10</p>
